title: The Assembly Agenda Committee Discusses a Reconvocation
subtitle: The chancellor is surprisingly eager to reopen the chamber.
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and staal_time == 4
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/reichstag.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= Assembly Reconvocation Decision

Behind closed doors, the Assembly’s agenda committee convenes to decide when to reconvene the chamber after the holiday break—and with our position on it, our spokesmen have a say. Representing the cabinet, Staal’s aide strikes a confident tone, declaring the government ready to face the chamber at any time—and even opposing any adjournment until no-confidence motions are dealt with.

In response, the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> table a motion to resume sessions early next week. [? if reichstag_president == "Gorrick": But the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> spokesmen show no interest, suggesting the decision be left to the Assembly’s president, Gorrick—who, in the end, fails to gain backing from any other party. ?][? if reichstag_president != "Gorrick": But the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> spokesmen show no interest, and would rather back the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>'s compromise motion. ?]

The question is, how should our representatives vote?

- @reichstag_1
- @reichstag_2
- @reichstag_3

@reichstag_1
title: Vote for the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivist**</span> motion to reconvene the chamber.
on-arrival: {!
Q.reichstag_staal = 1;
Q.reichstag_break = 0;

Q.next_reichstag_time = Q.rubicon_time + 3;
Q.next_reichstag_week = Q.week + 3;
Q.next_reichstag_month = Q.month;
Q.next_reichstag_year = Q.year;

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_month > 12) {
  Q.next_reichstag_month -= 12;
  Q.next_reichstag_year += 1;
}
!}

We must bring down the Staal cabinet as soon as possible. But the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> lack the votes on the committee to push the proposal through, as the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> vote it down.

Instead, the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> offers a compromise: the Assembly will reconvene early in Week [+ next_reichstag_week +], [+ next_reichstag_month : month +] [+ next_reichstag_year +], with the condition that the committee will reexamine the matter one week prior.

This is accepted by all parties.

@reichstag_2
title: Vote for the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> motion to grant responsibility to Gorrick.
view-if: reichstag_president == "Gorrick"
unavailable-subtitle: Why the hell would we do this?
choose-if: royalist_relation >= 100
on-arrival: {!
Q.reichstag_staal = 1;
Q.reichstag_break = 0;

Q.next_reichstag_time = Q.rubicon_time + 3;
Q.next_reichstag_week = Q.week + 3;
Q.next_reichstag_month = Q.month;
Q.next_reichstag_year = Q.year;

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_month > 12) {
  Q.next_reichstag_month -= 12;
  Q.next_reichstag_year += 1;
}
!}

For some reason, we have pushed for the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> proposal of letting Gorrick be in charge. However, our spokesmen simply laughed in our face at our "joke", and voted for the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivist**</span> motion.

Eventually, the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> steps in with a compromise: the Assembly will reconvene early in Week [+ next_reichstag_week +], [+ next_reichstag_month : month +] [+ next_reichstag_year +], on the condition that the committee revisits the matter one week beforehand.

All parties accept this arrangement.

@reichstag_3
title: Push for a compromise proposal (reconvene in three weeks, subject to review).
on-arrival: {!
Q.reichstag_staal = 1;
Q.reichstag_break = 0;

Q.next_reichstag_time = Q.rubicon_time + 3;
Q.next_reichstag_week = Q.week + 3;
Q.next_reichstag_month = Q.month;
Q.next_reichstag_year = Q.year;

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_month > 12) {
  Q.next_reichstag_month -= 12;
  Q.next_reichstag_year += 1;
}
!}

Together with the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>, our compromise proposal is accepted by all parties. The Assembly will reconvene early in Week [+ next_reichstag_week +], [+ next_reichstag_month : month +] [+ next_reichstag_year +], on the condition that the committee revisits the matter one week beforehand.